WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.440
EPISODE 5

01:40.560 --> 01:43.000
PAN RESTAURANT

01:45.640 --> 01:46.880
Say that again, I dare you.

01:46.960 --> 01:48.640
Master Fan, let's talk this over.

01:48.720 --> 01:50.280
For my sake,

01:50.360 --> 01:52.120
please let him go first.

01:52.200 --> 01:53.080
The Li family?

01:53.160 --> 01:54.800
They're nothing special.

01:54.880 --> 01:56.160
With just a beckon,

01:56.240 --> 01:58.880
they'd come running into my arms.

01:58.960 --> 01:59.920
You…

02:00.000 --> 02:01.360
drunk yourself silly.

02:01.440 --> 02:03.160
This is Fuhui's husband in front of you.

02:03.240 --> 02:04.520
What nonsense are you spouting?

02:04.600 --> 02:05.640
Stop pretending.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.240
Don't you know?

02:08.040 --> 02:09.040
Those perfume sellers,

02:09.120 --> 02:11.400
those so-called Jinnu and Yunu,

02:11.480 --> 02:12.920
are all from the Li family!

02:13.640 --> 02:14.680
Mr. Fan,

02:14.760 --> 02:17.840
which sister-in-law of yours
might that be?

02:17.920 --> 02:19.400
You're asking for it!

02:19.480 --> 02:20.760
Master Fan!

02:23.040 --> 02:24.120
Just hold your tongue.

02:24.760 --> 02:26.200
You heard this bastard's words.

02:26.280 --> 02:27.680
Don't stop me!

02:27.760 --> 02:29.880
What's new?

02:29.960 --> 02:31.160
Every time he drinks,

02:31.240 --> 02:32.600
he spews such drivel.

02:32.680 --> 02:33.960
Yesterday, it was Lady Zhang,

02:34.040 --> 02:35.680
today, it's Lady Li.

02:35.760 --> 02:38.360
Tomorrow, who knows?
Maybe someone from the palace.

02:39.440 --> 02:40.920
Exactly.

02:41.640 --> 02:46.160
He's clueless, rambling on like a fool.
He'll forget it all when he sobers up.

02:46.240 --> 02:48.640
If you take him seriously,

02:48.720 --> 02:49.720
you'll be the real joke.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.120
Right.

02:51.200 --> 02:52.240
Isn't that so?

02:52.320 --> 02:53.520
In his drunken dreams,

02:53.600 --> 02:55.400
forget the maidens of Bianjing,

02:55.480 --> 02:57.400
even the moon goddess
and fairies of heaven aren't spared.

02:57.480 --> 02:59.360
It's just his lips flapping.

02:59.440 --> 03:00.760
Talking nonsense at will.

03:00.840 --> 03:03.040
Liang Junqing, stop dreaming.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.160
What did you say?

03:04.240 --> 03:06.520
I'm telling you the truth…

03:08.760 --> 03:09.800
Clearly drunk!

03:09.880 --> 03:11.200
Hurry and get him back.

03:11.280 --> 03:12.160
Take him away!

03:14.120 --> 03:15.280
Apologies, everyone.

03:15.360 --> 03:16.480
My deepest apologies.

03:16.560 --> 03:17.640
Excuse me.

03:21.080 --> 03:22.320
Everyone.

03:22.400 --> 03:23.280
Everyone!

03:24.440 --> 03:25.760
A drunken guest caused a scene

03:25.840 --> 03:26.960
and disturbed your peace.

03:27.040 --> 03:28.240
- Deqing.
- Yes?

03:28.320 --> 03:30.160
Two more dishes and a jar of Jade Wine

03:30.240 --> 03:31.240
for every table.

03:31.840 --> 03:33.960
Many thanks, Master Chai.

03:34.800 --> 03:37.520
- Come with me.
- Master Chai, you're too kind.

03:40.640 --> 03:42.040
If not for you stopping me,

03:42.120 --> 03:45.080
I'd smash his head into a pulp!
He brought his insults right to me!

03:45.160 --> 03:46.280
If I didn't stop you,

03:46.360 --> 03:47.720
you'd brawl in Pan Restaurant

03:47.800 --> 03:48.840
and make it known to all.

03:48.920 --> 03:50.840
After that, the Li daughters

03:50.920 --> 03:51.880
would even be shamed

03:51.960 --> 03:53.400
just stepping out the door.

03:54.040 --> 03:56.160
They're delicate girls.
How could they bear such disgrace?

03:57.400 --> 03:58.720
Tomorrow night,

03:58.800 --> 04:01.520
I'll get some men
to teach that filthy dog a lesson.

04:01.600 --> 04:03.640
If you hit him today
and he's harmed tomorrow,

04:03.720 --> 04:04.840
wouldn't that make it clear to all

04:04.920 --> 04:05.880
it was your doing?

04:05.960 --> 04:07.120
I can't care about that!

04:07.200 --> 04:08.240
A son-in-law is half a son.

04:08.320 --> 04:09.800
The Li family's in trouble.
I can't stand by

04:09.880 --> 04:11.760
or let people mock me
as a coward without guts.

04:11.840 --> 04:12.760
Stop there!

04:15.880 --> 04:17.760
His father and brothers are commoners,

04:17.840 --> 04:19.840
but his uncle serves in the court.

04:19.920 --> 04:23.200
The Liang family can't harm you directly.
But can they not go after the Li family?

04:23.840 --> 04:25.320
Her family has just found some peace.

04:25.400 --> 04:27.320
One cannot act on impulse alone.

04:27.400 --> 04:28.960
If this won't do and that won't work,

04:29.040 --> 04:30.080
must we just endure it?

04:30.160 --> 04:33.680
Endure, but enduring
doesn't mean not avenging.

04:33.760 --> 04:35.480
Go back first. Let me think about it.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.600
Brother!

04:36.680 --> 04:37.640
Get lost!

04:56.440 --> 04:58.920
SIFU HOUSE

05:02.120 --> 05:03.040
What are you doing?

05:08.360 --> 05:09.800
I finally get it now.

05:11.840 --> 05:12.880
Sir,

05:12.960 --> 05:14.960
what can you achieve
by meddling in their matters?

05:15.040 --> 05:16.920
You only get slapped or splashed.

05:21.400 --> 05:23.080
And the water smells like plum blossoms.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.400
Who knows what it's even for?

05:24.480 --> 05:25.880
Why do you always have to speak?

05:27.800 --> 05:30.320
You delivered all the wine today.
Don't pass it off to someone else.

05:30.400 --> 05:31.760
Yes, yes.

05:31.840 --> 05:33.360
I'm just trying to help you.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.680
That Kangning is fierce.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.960
Always up to no good.

05:52.400 --> 05:54.080
Haode and Leshan are watching over her.

05:56.400 --> 05:58.880
She's wildly scared and agitated.

06:00.280 --> 06:01.880
In the end, it's all Chai's fault.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.280
You're wrong.

06:04.360 --> 06:06.800
Liang Junqing's the one to blame,

06:06.880 --> 06:08.400
not Master Chai.

06:09.000 --> 06:10.040
I've told you already.

06:10.120 --> 06:12.760
Master Chai took the fall
for someone else.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.920
He's been wronged.

06:14.000 --> 06:17.120
He's in with bad people,
so it means he's not different.

06:17.880 --> 06:20.400
Why lend the jade comb
to him of all people?

06:20.480 --> 06:23.080
If we don't expose him now,
he'll keep calling everyone his brother.

06:23.160 --> 06:25.240
Only because it didn't harm
the Chai girls.

06:25.880 --> 06:27.440
Even if he's wronged,

06:27.520 --> 06:29.760
he can't escape the blame
for poor judgment.

06:29.840 --> 06:31.400
And that Pan Restaurant,

06:31.480 --> 06:33.080
it's a den of vice.

06:33.160 --> 06:36.400
Drunken men come and go every day.
It's either old lechers or young rakes.

06:38.000 --> 06:41.400
- He's bound to face some retribution.
- You're wronging an innocent person.

06:41.480 --> 06:44.880
In business,
one must deal with all sorts of people.

06:44.960 --> 06:46.800
There's no telling who you'll meet.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.960
He's not a sage with all-seeing eyes.

06:49.040 --> 06:52.960
I don't want to hear his name again. I…
Just hearing his name makes me feel like

06:53.040 --> 06:55.640
all the old grudges
are rushing to my heart.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.320
I can't help but wish
I could kick him again!

06:57.400 --> 06:59.000
Alright, I won't bring him up again.

06:59.080 --> 07:00.200
Alright?

07:04.840 --> 07:08.120
Shouhua, what should we do about Qiongnu?

07:08.760 --> 07:10.360
Mother's furious.

07:10.440 --> 07:11.800
She nearly came over.

07:11.880 --> 07:12.920
I had to stop her.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.200
This must not be made public.

07:15.280 --> 07:19.280
That bastard won't dare
offend the other families,

07:19.360 --> 07:21.680
but he's bold enough to bully us,
strangers in an unfamiliar land.

07:21.760 --> 07:23.920
The Fan family is just a trading family,

07:24.000 --> 07:25.360
not one to push too far.

07:25.960 --> 07:29.000
I think we should deal with Qiongnu later.

07:34.360 --> 07:36.240
Sir, take it easy.

07:48.560 --> 07:50.080
You know where to send news.

07:52.360 --> 07:54.320
Don't worry, sister, I know.

07:54.400 --> 07:55.480
Go on.

08:01.400 --> 08:02.240
Kangning.

08:02.320 --> 08:03.600
Let's go.

08:06.880 --> 08:08.320
Master Chai?

08:11.040 --> 08:12.120
Kangning.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.560
May I have a word with you?

08:17.640 --> 08:19.040
Chunlai, you may leave.

08:21.400 --> 08:23.640
You two, come with me.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.360
I wonder if Master Chai is here

08:29.960 --> 08:31.800
to settle the score for that slap.

08:31.880 --> 08:32.880
Or…

08:33.680 --> 08:35.520
Aren't you going to teach
Liang Junqing a lesson?

08:36.040 --> 08:37.560
I'm here to lend you a hand.

08:38.560 --> 08:41.000
I slapped you, yet you bear no grudge.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.200
And you are willing to help me?

08:42.840 --> 08:44.000
How strange.

08:44.560 --> 08:45.960
He tricked me out of my jade comb

08:46.040 --> 08:48.760
and accused me of indecency.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.280
I can't forgive him for that.

08:55.920 --> 08:58.520
Kangning, I am truly here to help you.

08:58.600 --> 09:00.200
Don't miss this chance.

09:04.280 --> 09:05.800
I wonder how Master Chai

09:06.440 --> 09:07.760
plans to help me.

09:10.560 --> 09:12.920
That depends on your sincerity.

09:26.480 --> 09:27.920
There have been misunderstandings,

09:28.000 --> 09:29.280
hence my offenses.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.320
You are a noble man.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.920
Please do not blame my rashness.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.760
I apologize once more.

09:36.400 --> 09:37.680
Kangning,

09:37.760 --> 09:39.560
you're quite adaptable.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.640
May I ask,

09:42.720 --> 09:44.040
how would you take revenge?

09:45.120 --> 09:47.320
Let him enjoy a few more days.

09:47.400 --> 09:49.640
We'll deal with him at Chongyang.

09:52.760 --> 09:54.000
- I'll pick this one.
- Here you are.

09:54.080 --> 09:55.480
- Do you have any in white?
- Alright.

09:55.560 --> 09:57.320
- So fragrant! Here you are.
- Here's the money.

09:57.400 --> 09:59.160
This one looks nice too.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.200
Yes.

10:00.280 --> 10:02.800
Come see the Chongyang cake,

10:02.880 --> 10:04.240
fresh from the oven!

10:04.320 --> 10:05.400
Put them out.

10:05.480 --> 10:07.280
Place them there. This one's good.

10:07.360 --> 10:09.040
Alright, go quickly!

10:09.120 --> 10:10.560
Come see the Chongyang cakes,

10:10.640 --> 10:12.840
fresh from the oven!

10:12.920 --> 10:14.480
Twenty coins per box.

10:14.560 --> 10:15.920
Just out of the oven.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.280
Madam Li.

10:17.360 --> 10:19.800
Your Chongyang cakes,
aren't they just sugar and flour?

10:19.880 --> 10:22.120
Why are they pricier than others?

10:22.200 --> 10:23.080
That's right.

10:23.160 --> 10:27.560
But my cakes come with meaning!

10:27.640 --> 10:30.680
This box, "All Things Well",

10:30.760 --> 10:31.960
it's blessed

10:32.040 --> 10:34.640
by the Lion-Taming King of Bodhisattvas.

10:34.720 --> 10:37.600
If a scholar buys it,

10:37.680 --> 10:41.680
Manjushri will grant wisdom.

10:41.760 --> 10:43.800
It'll boost talent

10:43.880 --> 10:46.160
and bring honor to their ancestors.

11:07.840 --> 11:09.320
But the uncle I'm gifting it to

11:09.400 --> 11:10.640
is an official.

11:10.720 --> 11:12.680
Don't you have something else?

11:12.760 --> 11:15.760
Of course, we do! Come!

11:15.840 --> 11:17.560
Look at this one.

11:17.640 --> 11:19.600
See the little deer?

11:19.680 --> 11:21.600
"Eat the Deer,

11:21.680 --> 11:23.480
Feast on Fortune."

11:23.560 --> 11:26.280
Officials who take it home

11:26.360 --> 11:27.960
will rise step by step.

11:28.800 --> 11:30.160
Your second uncle,

11:30.240 --> 11:32.360
isn't he the oil merchant Master Wang?

11:32.440 --> 11:34.920
- Yes!
- Then, take this one.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.640
Prosperity Cake.

11:36.720 --> 11:40.040
It ensures luck and wealth,

11:40.120 --> 11:42.720
I promise!

11:42.800 --> 11:44.160
I'll take one!

11:44.880 --> 11:46.400
I want one too!

11:50.480 --> 11:51.880
Just a cake

11:51.960 --> 11:53.480
with deer and elephants

11:53.560 --> 11:54.800
and endless meanings!

11:55.680 --> 11:58.680
Kangning, typically you.

11:58.760 --> 12:00.360
We've been at this for seven days.

12:01.800 --> 12:02.800
Shouhua,

12:02.880 --> 12:04.720
shouldn't you let us out for a break?

12:05.440 --> 12:07.040
The family business is booming

12:07.120 --> 12:08.920
and you just want to play.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.160
Look at Fuhui.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.960
She's been helping all morning.

12:12.960 --> 12:15.360
Didn't I come early too?

12:18.160 --> 12:21.520
Shouhua, please let us out!

12:21.600 --> 12:22.720
Even the lion is saying,

12:22.800 --> 12:24.640
"Let me out! Let me play!"

12:25.240 --> 12:26.720
Shouhua, look.

12:26.800 --> 12:28.000
This one's done too.

12:28.920 --> 12:31.360
I heard of a lion meeting
at Kaibao Temple.

12:31.440 --> 12:34.280
I'd like to hear the master's sermon.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.360
May I go?

12:37.000 --> 12:38.200
Shouhua?

12:38.800 --> 12:41.160
Please let me go.

12:41.240 --> 12:42.520
Please.

12:43.720 --> 12:45.880
Kids will be kids, always wanting to play.

12:45.960 --> 12:47.360
Let them go.

12:48.040 --> 12:49.480
But…

12:50.280 --> 12:51.440
no causing trouble.

12:51.520 --> 12:53.160
I never cause trouble!

12:53.240 --> 12:54.480
You? Never?

12:54.560 --> 12:56.000
Go on, go on.

12:56.080 --> 12:57.560
- But be careful!
- Let's go!

12:57.640 --> 12:58.680
- Hurry up!
- Wait for me!

12:58.760 --> 13:01.000
- Be back early!
- Coming. Wait for me!

13:01.080 --> 13:02.400
Take it slow.

13:08.920 --> 13:11.640
Do you still remember,
during the Chongyang Festival that year,

13:11.720 --> 13:14.320
Haode went to the temple with Mother?

13:14.400 --> 13:17.200
She met a handsome young monk

13:17.280 --> 13:19.120
and secretly followed him.

13:19.200 --> 13:20.680
Thankfully, someone noticed

13:20.760 --> 13:21.760
and brought her back.

13:22.360 --> 13:24.720
They said he came from
a long line of officials,

13:25.360 --> 13:28.200
sent there fearing he'd die young.
So, they had him raised as a monk.

13:29.400 --> 13:31.520
Qiongnu, do you remember

13:31.600 --> 13:33.000
which family it was?

13:33.080 --> 13:34.680
I just can't recall.

13:35.720 --> 13:37.160
Yes.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.720
I seem to remember that.

13:40.440 --> 13:42.400
But I can't recall, either.

13:42.480 --> 13:44.280
She was only seven that year

13:44.800 --> 13:46.480
and already fancied a handsome man!

14:09.440 --> 14:11.920
Didn't you say Master Chai was here?

14:12.000 --> 14:13.800
That's what the servant said.

14:14.640 --> 14:16.080
Maybe he's not here yet.

14:16.160 --> 14:17.640
Give me two bowls.

14:17.720 --> 14:18.840
Coming right up.

14:26.000 --> 14:27.680
METAL AND STONE ANTIQUES

14:29.160 --> 14:31.040
This golden Mahoraga is so cute!

14:31.680 --> 14:33.160
It's perfect for Fuhui.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.680
Sharp choice, young lady.

14:35.280 --> 14:36.600
The others are clay,

14:36.680 --> 14:37.600
but this one's gold.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.760
A fine symbol of blessings and fertility.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.200
It's just too pricey.

14:42.280 --> 14:43.720
Left unsold after the Qixi Festival.

14:43.800 --> 14:45.160
So, I thought I'd bring it out

14:45.240 --> 14:46.320
to try and make some money.

14:46.400 --> 14:48.520
Would you like
to try your luck, young lady?

14:51.440 --> 14:53.280
- How?
- Five coins a turn.

14:53.360 --> 14:56.280
Get all five coins to land face up

14:56.360 --> 14:57.720
and the golden Mahoraga

14:58.640 --> 14:59.640
is yours.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.760
I'm good at this. Let's try!

15:06.920 --> 15:07.920
Here we go.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.440
Young lady, you…

15:20.040 --> 15:21.120
Go ahead.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.800
All coins are face up!

15:24.520 --> 15:26.160
The golden Mahoraga is ours now.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.400
Wait, wait!

15:28.520 --> 15:29.840
A bet's a bet.

15:29.920 --> 15:31.560
What's wrong with you?

15:31.640 --> 15:34.920
It's just gold-plated
and you can't even let it go.

15:35.520 --> 15:36.400
Believe me,

15:36.480 --> 15:38.280
I'll flip your stall over.

15:38.360 --> 15:39.320
I wouldn't dare!

15:39.400 --> 15:40.800
It's just that

15:40.880 --> 15:42.640
this Mahoraga

15:42.720 --> 15:44.840
was already won by a young man.

15:44.920 --> 15:47.400
He said he'd come back for it later.

15:47.480 --> 15:48.800
I thought

15:48.880 --> 15:51.760
I could get a few more bets in.

15:51.840 --> 15:54.560
How can you gamble the same thing twice?
Shameless!

15:54.640 --> 15:56.760
No, no, please!

15:56.840 --> 15:58.240
I won it first.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.200
It's mine!

16:01.960 --> 16:03.880
Kangning, don't act on impulse.

16:03.960 --> 16:05.920
Don't forget why we're here today.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.600
Go ahead.

16:11.720 --> 16:12.800
Follow me.

16:34.720 --> 16:35.800
This…

16:39.640 --> 16:42.600
I've long heard of your beauty and wit.

16:42.680 --> 16:43.520
But I think

16:43.600 --> 16:45.080
you're good at everything,

16:45.160 --> 16:46.440
except for one thing.

16:47.560 --> 16:50.200
After crossing paths a few times, I think,

16:50.280 --> 16:53.000
aside from being shrewd and wealthy,

16:53.080 --> 16:54.960
you lack in almost everything else.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.640
I wonder what's the purpose
of this invitation?

17:01.120 --> 17:02.360
Kangning, take a look.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.040
Him?

17:44.560 --> 17:46.280
Master Chai, what does this mean?

17:46.920 --> 17:47.960
Don't rush.

17:48.040 --> 17:49.120
You'll know by tonight.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.920
Don't trick me, Master.

17:51.760 --> 17:53.800
Chunlai, go home and inform them.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.720
Say I've gone to attend the sermon.

17:55.800 --> 17:57.080
Don't let Mother worry.

17:57.760 --> 17:59.000
Got it.

17:59.080 --> 18:01.200
I'll be back soon. Don't go anywhere!

18:10.440 --> 18:13.680
- Great!
- Great!

18:14.680 --> 18:16.040
Wonderful!

18:16.640 --> 18:18.840
Excellent!

18:20.080 --> 18:21.680
Kangning,

18:21.760 --> 18:23.600
these shrimp dumplings are delicious!

18:24.800 --> 18:26.600
- Take them.
- The market's crowded.

18:26.680 --> 18:28.320
We must come here more often.

18:30.000 --> 18:32.880
Master Chai, it's already dark.

18:32.960 --> 18:34.320
How long are we waiting?

18:34.400 --> 18:36.120
So eager for revenge?

18:37.920 --> 18:39.640
If not for someone's vanity

18:39.720 --> 18:40.920
and disregard for propriety,

18:41.000 --> 18:42.880
things wouldn't have come to this.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.640
And yet you defend her.

18:45.720 --> 18:47.120
So foolish.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.280
Seeking fortune and status
is human nature.

18:50.360 --> 18:53.240
A girl with no family support or dowry

18:53.840 --> 18:55.480
just wants someone to rely on.

18:55.560 --> 18:56.880
How is that unforgivable?

18:57.640 --> 19:00.360
Why blame her instead of the culprit?

19:00.440 --> 19:02.400
If it were your own sister,

19:02.480 --> 19:03.760
could you still say that?

19:05.120 --> 19:06.920
Fine, I was wrong.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.280
If you leave now,

19:08.360 --> 19:09.560
today will have been wasted.

19:15.000 --> 19:16.680
The righteous Kangning indeed.

19:16.760 --> 19:19.120
But your stubborn pride will never change.

19:19.200 --> 19:21.160
One day, it'll cost you dearly.

19:34.800 --> 19:36.000
He's here.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.600
Let's go! Come on!

19:48.120 --> 19:50.160
- Kangning.
- Kangning.

19:50.240 --> 19:51.120
Please.

19:54.400 --> 19:56.480
What, think I'd trick you?

20:04.680 --> 20:05.800
Do visit again!

20:07.200 --> 20:08.120
Take care!

20:11.400 --> 20:13.480
Didn't you say you have two sisters?

20:14.040 --> 20:15.520
Both beauties.

20:15.600 --> 20:16.920
Please bring them out!

20:17.000 --> 20:18.120
I'd like to pay my respects.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.960
Why is this room so dim?

20:24.560 --> 20:25.840
I'll have someone light a lamp.

20:27.840 --> 20:29.120
Gosh.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.680
- Who's there?
- Bitch!

20:30.760 --> 20:32.120
I've heard the rumors

20:32.200 --> 20:33.280
that you've been unfaithful.

20:33.360 --> 20:35.880
- Caught you red-handed! Tie them up!
- Let me go!

20:35.960 --> 20:36.960
Sir!

20:37.040 --> 20:38.560
A brute climbed in

20:38.640 --> 20:39.920
to commit a vile act!

20:40.000 --> 20:41.480
I'm innocent!

20:42.680 --> 20:43.960
Let me go!

20:44.040 --> 20:45.160
Spare me!

20:45.240 --> 20:46.200
Quit pretending!

20:46.760 --> 20:47.960
I'll deal with him first,

20:48.040 --> 20:49.240
then you.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.440
Do it!

20:51.720 --> 20:52.640
Let me go!

20:52.720 --> 20:54.040
Let me go!

20:55.600 --> 20:56.760
Let me go!

21:12.120 --> 21:13.440
Enough.

21:21.280 --> 21:22.680
This?

21:28.920 --> 21:30.240
Stop playing dead!

21:30.320 --> 21:31.360
Keep going!

21:32.160 --> 21:34.000
Then strip him
and dump him in the mass grave.

21:34.080 --> 21:35.200
Hit him!

21:57.680 --> 21:59.440
- He won't…?
- Don't worry.

21:59.520 --> 22:01.880
They're trained. They know his limit.

22:01.960 --> 22:03.440
Break his leg,

22:03.520 --> 22:05.040
so he won't harm others again.

22:05.120 --> 22:06.240
It won't kill him.

22:07.000 --> 22:09.160
Aren't you afraid he'll come after you?

22:09.240 --> 22:11.560
He attacked a married woman
and ruined her name.

22:11.640 --> 22:14.200
Caught in the act, beaten by the wronged.

22:14.280 --> 22:16.280
Even if he takes it to court,

22:16.360 --> 22:17.920
he won't dare speak of it.

22:18.560 --> 22:19.880
Besides,

22:19.960 --> 22:22.480
by dawn, we're gone. Who will he find?

22:22.560 --> 22:24.120
It's just bad luck for him.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.160
He ran into the wrong crowd.

22:27.680 --> 22:31.520
This honey trap feels familiar.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.640
I just wanted to remind someone.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.320
Kangning,

22:41.400 --> 22:43.920
act cleanly and thoroughly.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.000
Leave no loose ends.

22:53.160 --> 22:54.280
It's for you.

22:55.400 --> 22:56.320
Really?

22:57.000 --> 22:58.960
We attended the sermon
and wandered around the market.

22:59.040 --> 23:00.280
We came back empty-handed.

23:00.360 --> 23:01.440
This is raising suspicion.

23:39.280 --> 23:40.440
Let's go home.

23:41.160 --> 23:42.040
Let's go.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.520
Here, have some.

24:05.560 --> 24:07.920
You've lost weight.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.360
And you don't go out much lately.

24:10.360 --> 24:11.880
- Qiongnu, you--
- Shouhua.

24:13.400 --> 24:15.040
I'm fine now.

24:16.000 --> 24:17.000
Don't worry about me.

24:18.560 --> 24:21.680
She's loved roasted goose since little.
Let's visit the night market tonight.

24:21.760 --> 24:24.040
That five-flavor almond goose
from Granny Ma.

24:24.120 --> 24:25.640
It's so delicious.

24:25.720 --> 24:27.800
One bite
and all your troubles will vanish.

24:35.520 --> 24:38.040
I heard that Liang

24:38.120 --> 24:40.000
offended some lady

24:40.080 --> 24:41.520
and got his leg broken.

24:41.600 --> 24:43.000
Afraid of more trouble,

24:43.080 --> 24:44.720
he fled to his hometown
Shouzhou overnight.

24:45.640 --> 24:47.320
We won't see him again.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.280
What are you sewing?

24:50.720 --> 24:52.440
That looks fun. Give it to me!

24:54.360 --> 24:56.080
It's for Fuhui.

24:56.680 --> 24:58.320
Oh? Let me see.

25:11.880 --> 25:13.080
Look at you,

25:13.160 --> 25:15.400
clinging to your little treasure.

25:15.480 --> 25:17.680
I'll get her something better next time.

25:17.760 --> 25:19.120
This…

25:19.960 --> 25:21.600
A golden Mahoraga.

25:21.680 --> 25:23.200
I can't accept this.

25:23.280 --> 25:25.480
Next time, just bring a clay one.

25:37.840 --> 25:38.720
Feeling better?

25:46.960 --> 25:49.800
Kangning said we're going
to the night market tonight.

25:49.880 --> 25:51.560
Sounds great. Let's go together.

25:52.160 --> 25:53.440
I heard from my husband

25:53.520 --> 25:55.800
that there's been some thieves
in the city.

25:56.400 --> 25:57.320
They target

25:57.400 --> 25:59.640
wealthy children and young women

25:59.720 --> 26:01.480
in the chaos.

26:02.080 --> 26:05.600
Last month, they took the only daughter
of Master Jiang from the east side.

26:06.200 --> 26:07.760
The authorities have posted notices,

26:07.840 --> 26:09.080
but she's still missing.

26:09.680 --> 26:11.000
You believe that?

26:11.080 --> 26:12.560
He's just scaring you.

26:13.600 --> 26:15.520
I'm on the streets every day

26:15.600 --> 26:17.840
and never heard of such a thing.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.120
Just rumors.

26:19.640 --> 26:21.080
Let's go.

26:25.280 --> 26:26.760
Shouhua, come with us.

26:30.040 --> 26:31.480
I'm not going. You guys go ahead.

26:32.480 --> 26:34.200
But to be safe,

26:34.280 --> 26:36.200
have the Fan family
send a few guards along.

26:37.680 --> 26:39.920
Please, come on!

26:41.160 --> 26:42.560
Alright!

26:43.160 --> 26:45.600
Haode, please! Let's go play!

26:51.080 --> 26:52.120
Drink it while it's hot.

26:57.040 --> 26:58.280
Slowly.

27:05.520 --> 27:07.320
Master Chai, please wait.

27:07.960 --> 27:09.040
No need to see me off.

27:10.120 --> 27:11.440
Fire!

27:11.520 --> 27:12.800
A fire at Cross Street!

27:12.880 --> 27:14.560
What's going on? Look, it's a fire!

27:14.640 --> 27:15.840
Fire's spreading!

27:15.920 --> 27:17.560
Whose place is it this time?

27:17.640 --> 27:19.920
Must've started in the kitchen.

27:20.520 --> 27:21.960
Last time at Shouning Temple,

27:22.040 --> 27:24.680
it was the stove catching the walls.

27:24.760 --> 27:25.880
Look at those flames!

27:25.960 --> 27:28.080
That area's packed with houses.

27:28.160 --> 27:29.800
- Exactly.
- One house after another.

27:29.880 --> 27:31.560
Half the city might go up in flames.

27:31.640 --> 27:32.960
This is bad, really bad!

27:33.560 --> 27:36.640
What are you standing here for?
Our house is at the end of the street!

27:36.720 --> 27:37.880
Hurry and check on it!

27:37.960 --> 27:40.760
- Mother's out traveling.
- Your big house is still there!

27:40.840 --> 27:42.760
Your wealth is going
to be burnt in a flash.

27:42.840 --> 27:45.000
Hurry! You're driving me mad!

27:45.080 --> 27:46.240
- Deqing!
- Yes?

27:47.040 --> 27:48.400
Bring everyone from the restaurant.

27:49.360 --> 27:50.640
Get all the silver from the safe.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.360
No.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.800
It's not enough, not nearly enough!

27:53.880 --> 27:55.120
I'll exchange more silver first.

27:55.200 --> 27:56.040
We'll meet up later.

27:56.120 --> 27:57.600
- Got it!
- Brother!

27:57.680 --> 27:59.720
The fire's at Cross Street,
near your house!

27:59.800 --> 28:00.920
Why are you leaving the city?

28:01.000 --> 28:02.360
- Get ready!
- Yes!

28:02.440 --> 28:03.520
You four, come with me!

28:03.600 --> 28:06.280
You're going the wrong way!
Have you lost your head in the panic?

28:06.360 --> 28:08.600
- What are you doing running off now?
- Move! Mount up!

28:08.680 --> 28:09.800
Let go!

28:18.640 --> 28:19.880
Your pancake, madam.

28:19.960 --> 28:21.840
- Thank you.
- Let's have more fun next time.

28:21.920 --> 28:24.600
- Smells great!
- Good idea!

28:24.680 --> 28:25.600
Madam, have a taste.

28:25.680 --> 28:27.320
- No, thank you.
- Tasty roasted goose.

28:27.400 --> 28:29.040
Look, roasted goose! Let's go!

28:29.120 --> 28:30.320
Hurry!

28:31.200 --> 28:32.600
- Take a look, ladies.
- Let's go look.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.000
- Not full yet?
- Tasty roasted goose!

28:34.080 --> 28:36.280
No, I just want one!

28:37.120 --> 28:39.080
You've already eaten so much.

28:39.160 --> 28:40.040
No more.

28:40.120 --> 28:41.120
Good and cheap!

28:41.200 --> 28:42.360
- Fine, do what you want.
- Please.

28:42.440 --> 28:44.520
- Just one more!
- Suit yourself.

28:44.600 --> 28:46.600
Steamed buns for sale!

28:47.440 --> 28:48.720
I'll buy it for you.

28:48.800 --> 28:49.920
Which one do you want?

28:50.000 --> 28:51.520
- Qiongnu, let's go.
- I’ll take this one.

28:51.600 --> 28:53.040
Fine pearl necklaces!

28:53.120 --> 28:53.960
I want one too.

28:54.040 --> 28:55.040
These are South Sea pearls.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.560
Each one is dazzling.

28:58.240 --> 28:59.480
Look at this one.

29:00.560 --> 29:02.280
This little rabbit suits you.

29:03.760 --> 29:05.320
See if there's one you like.

29:05.960 --> 29:07.640
- I like this one!
- I like this one too.

29:07.720 --> 29:09.120
- Let me see that.
- Okay.

29:09.200 --> 29:11.240
- Why not buy one?
- Here, madam.

29:12.280 --> 29:13.560
- Sir.
- Pick your favorite!

29:13.640 --> 29:15.200
Here, you can always get more.

29:15.280 --> 29:16.520
Thank you, Fuhui!

29:16.600 --> 29:17.600
What about mine?

29:17.680 --> 29:19.240
It's all together.

29:19.320 --> 29:21.160
Young lady, I have even finer ones.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.440
Take a look.

29:22.520 --> 29:23.920
I'll take what my sister picks.

29:24.000 --> 29:25.600
Young lady, you have excellent taste.

29:31.520 --> 29:32.600
My lady,

29:33.200 --> 29:34.040
the cart is ready.

29:34.120 --> 29:36.080
If we don't head back, Master will worry.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.960
It's late. We should go home.

29:43.040 --> 29:44.480
Let's come back another day, alright?

29:44.560 --> 29:45.560
Alright.

29:46.560 --> 29:48.120
Paid!

29:48.200 --> 29:49.560
Let's go.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.400
But I don't want to leave yet!

29:51.480 --> 29:52.720
Come on.

29:52.800 --> 29:53.840
Take care. Come again!

29:55.200 --> 29:57.120
But I'm not done playing!

29:57.200 --> 29:59.520
You're not done? None of us are!

29:59.600 --> 30:00.640
Sister,

30:00.720 --> 30:02.880
there are shadow puppets
and snake charmers over there!

30:02.960 --> 30:04.400
- Let's just take a look!
- Another day.

30:04.480 --> 30:06.120
- How about another day?
- Go. Go home first.

30:06.200 --> 30:07.640
We're heading out first!

30:07.720 --> 30:10.360
- Leshan!
- Great!

30:10.440 --> 30:12.600
- Go with them and keep watching.
- Got it.

30:13.360 --> 30:14.720
Come back early!

30:17.280 --> 30:18.320
Let's go!

30:28.320 --> 30:29.440
Fire!

30:29.520 --> 30:30.920
A fire in the north!

30:32.280 --> 30:34.160
Fire in the north! Clear the way!

30:36.840 --> 30:38.280
Qiongnu, get in the cart!

30:40.160 --> 30:41.480
Qiongnu!

30:45.640 --> 30:46.840
Kangning!

30:46.920 --> 30:48.400
Kangning!

30:48.480 --> 30:49.760
Fuhui!

30:49.840 --> 30:50.840
Stop!

30:51.480 --> 30:53.400
- Fuhui!
- Kangning!

30:54.000 --> 30:55.080
- Kangning!
- Not good!

30:55.160 --> 30:57.080
- Someone! We've been attacked!
- Go report this.

30:57.160 --> 30:58.320
Got it!

30:58.400 --> 31:00.280
- Fuhui!
- Kangning!

31:09.120 --> 31:10.520
Careful. Someone's coming!

31:11.240 --> 31:12.800
- Don't move!
- Stay still!

31:15.160 --> 31:16.280
Quiet!

31:30.200 --> 31:31.120
Brother.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.280
You're the clever one.

31:32.880 --> 31:36.040
The soldiers will handle the fire there.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.320
Even if you go,

31:37.400 --> 31:38.800
you'll just get in the way.

31:38.880 --> 31:40.640
After this fire,

31:40.720 --> 31:42.920
the north will need countless repairs.

31:43.000 --> 31:46.080
I control most of the city's
construction supplies now.

31:46.160 --> 31:48.000
This is the real way to profit.

31:48.600 --> 31:50.920
A single house means nothing.

31:51.000 --> 31:52.640
Later, take the goods to the warehouse.

31:52.720 --> 31:53.800
I have a guest to meet.

31:53.880 --> 31:55.000
Who?

31:56.720 --> 31:58.880
Take less from the common folk.

31:58.960 --> 32:01.240
Don't let them call you
a heartless rich man.

32:02.600 --> 32:03.800
I'll make a fortune.

32:03.880 --> 32:07.040
Not just from the nobles,

32:07.120 --> 32:08.200
but by having someone

32:08.280 --> 32:09.720
report the fire to the palace,

32:09.800 --> 32:11.840
so His Majesty knows the damage,

32:11.920 --> 32:14.840
and I'll have the taxes
on my materials waived.

32:16.080 --> 32:17.160
Impressive.

32:20.280 --> 32:21.320
Please, help me!

32:21.400 --> 32:23.160
My sisters have been kidnapped!

32:23.240 --> 32:24.520
The cart's not far.

32:24.600 --> 32:26.240
We can still catch it!

32:26.320 --> 32:27.760
Please, help me!

32:27.840 --> 32:29.760
We have orders to head to the north.

32:29.840 --> 32:30.840
We can't delay.

32:30.920 --> 32:32.320
Go report it to the authorities.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.120
- Please!
- Master Congyi, let's go!

32:34.200 --> 32:35.480
Save them, please!

32:37.760 --> 32:38.720
Kangning.

32:39.560 --> 32:40.800
Kangning.

32:41.440 --> 32:43.280
Someone, help me!

32:43.360 --> 32:44.560
Kangning.

32:45.880 --> 32:46.880
You're from the Li family?

32:47.640 --> 32:49.080
Master Chai, Kangning…

32:49.160 --> 32:50.960
She's been taken!

32:51.040 --> 32:52.160
Please save her!

32:52.240 --> 32:53.240
Fuhui…

32:53.320 --> 32:54.920
She's on the cart too!

32:55.000 --> 32:56.720
- What?
- Quick, where's the cart?

32:57.400 --> 32:59.280
Over there! That way!

33:00.880 --> 33:02.000
That's the one!

33:02.080 --> 33:03.200
Deqing, take her back.

33:03.280 --> 33:05.080
- Got it.
- Rest of you, follow me!

33:22.400 --> 33:23.840
Sir, it's to the right.

33:23.920 --> 33:25.360
Cousin.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.520
Lives are at stake. Don't mess this up.

33:27.600 --> 33:29.480
They've traveled far and wide with me,

33:29.560 --> 33:31.080
faced countless bandits.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.240
Their skills are decent.

33:32.320 --> 33:33.520
No mistake. Let's go!

33:42.360 --> 33:43.560
Hurry!

33:46.560 --> 33:48.200
Stay here and watch them.

33:48.280 --> 33:49.160
Got it.

33:49.240 --> 33:51.520
Rest of you, keep this place secure.

33:52.280 --> 33:53.360
Let's go.

33:56.040 --> 33:56.880
Stay put!

34:34.800 --> 34:35.720
Find somewhere to hide.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.920
Cousin, they're all caught!

35:41.000 --> 35:42.520
Spare us, sir! Spare us!

35:42.600 --> 35:43.800
Mercy!

35:43.880 --> 35:45.720
Bandit, where did you take my wife?

35:45.800 --> 35:47.720
I only thought they looked lovely.

35:47.800 --> 35:49.400
I wanted to offer them to my leader

35:49.480 --> 35:51.320
or sell them to a wealthy lord,

35:51.400 --> 35:52.720
but I never laid a finger on them.

35:52.800 --> 35:53.800
Take her back.

35:53.880 --> 35:55.520
- Please spare us!
- Yes.

35:55.600 --> 35:56.640
Gag him.

35:56.720 --> 35:57.760
Sir.

35:59.960 --> 36:02.320
Seems to be a small band
taking shelter here.

36:02.400 --> 36:04.880
Tie them up, hand them to the authorities.
We'll find their lair soon.

36:07.880 --> 36:08.920
No rush.

36:10.040 --> 36:12.000
Save my wife first and we'll talk later.

36:12.080 --> 36:13.600
If your wife asks later

36:13.680 --> 36:14.640
why you didn't guard her,

36:14.720 --> 36:16.720
knowing there were bandits,
what will you say?

36:17.320 --> 36:18.760
And if she asks

36:18.840 --> 36:20.520
why you abandoned your ledger

36:20.600 --> 36:22.760
to drink at Pan Restaurant
the moment she left,

36:22.840 --> 36:24.320
what will your excuse be?

36:24.400 --> 36:26.400
Instead of gratitude,

36:26.480 --> 36:28.400
you'll get blamed.

36:29.960 --> 36:32.760
If you want to live at her mercy forever,

36:32.840 --> 36:33.840
then go ahead.

36:59.800 --> 37:01.360
Kangning, listen to me.

37:01.440 --> 37:03.320
If we can escape, it's a blessing.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.920
If we can't,

37:05.000 --> 37:06.360
don't throw your life away.

37:06.440 --> 37:08.240
Do whatever they demand.

37:08.320 --> 37:09.920
Gold and jewels mean nothing.

37:10.000 --> 37:11.680
Even chastity is meaningless.

37:12.320 --> 37:14.000
Our lives are what matter.

37:14.080 --> 37:15.640
Only then can we return to Mother.

37:36.160 --> 37:37.880
That's the wife I know.

37:38.720 --> 37:40.520
If it comes to the worst,

37:41.280 --> 37:43.840
I only want her alive.

37:43.920 --> 37:45.880
No matter where she's sold,

37:45.960 --> 37:47.360
I'll find her.

37:48.560 --> 37:52.880
Fuhui is wise and resolute.

37:52.960 --> 37:55.720
Not one to be swayed easily.
Are you still trying to scare her?

37:55.800 --> 37:57.160
Of course, I am.

37:57.240 --> 37:59.560
If she had obeyed,
she wouldn't be suffering like this.

38:00.120 --> 38:03.000
An obedient wife is the best wife.

38:04.520 --> 38:06.040
Then you'd better steel yourself.

38:06.120 --> 38:07.520
If you regret halfway…

38:07.600 --> 38:08.560
Don't worry, brother.

38:08.640 --> 38:10.960
I swear, no regrets.

38:11.560 --> 38:13.480
I've heard that a thousand times.

38:13.560 --> 38:15.080
- Remember.
- Got it, brother.

38:15.160 --> 38:16.480
I'll never tell, no matter what.

38:19.200 --> 38:20.040
Come here.

39:02.520 --> 39:03.560
Don't move!

39:04.360 --> 39:06.400
Mr. Zhang, outside Guangli Gate,

39:06.480 --> 39:07.640
offered 200 strings.

39:07.720 --> 39:09.560
He wants a young and pretty one.

39:09.640 --> 39:10.560
Follow my plan.

39:10.640 --> 39:12.800
Send her tonight. No delays.

39:22.120 --> 39:24.480
Great. Better we split it for drinks

39:24.560 --> 39:26.440
than give it to the boss.

39:26.520 --> 39:28.320
But 200 strings is too little.

39:28.400 --> 39:29.920
This work risks our heads.

39:30.000 --> 39:31.680
We should extort more from him.

39:31.760 --> 39:33.240
Don't talk nonsense.

39:33.320 --> 39:35.160
No drinking or sleeping tonight.

39:35.240 --> 39:36.320
Keep your eyes open.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.600
Watch this woman closely.

39:38.200 --> 39:39.840
So we can explain to our superiors.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.640
There's one more thing.

39:42.240 --> 39:43.560
The boss hasn't picked yet.

39:43.640 --> 39:45.480
Don't you dare touch her first.

39:49.040 --> 39:49.920
Get up!

39:50.880 --> 39:51.880
Move!

40:17.440 --> 40:18.560
Make another sound

40:18.640 --> 40:20.160
and I'll toss you down the cliff.

40:35.680 --> 40:37.160
I haven't run.

40:37.240 --> 40:38.600
I'm doing as told.

40:38.680 --> 40:39.920
Why torment me?

40:41.040 --> 40:42.360
I've been frail since I was young.

40:43.000 --> 40:45.040
If I die on the way,

40:45.120 --> 40:46.480
wouldn't your efforts be wasted?

40:47.160 --> 40:48.640
Behave and listen.

40:49.480 --> 40:51.880
Once the deal's done, we part ways.

41:00.600 --> 41:02.560
I overheard in the bag.

41:03.160 --> 41:05.680
How much are you selling me for?

41:07.080 --> 41:09.600
That's right. Two hundred strings.

41:10.200 --> 41:12.520
I can brew tea and light incense.

41:12.600 --> 41:14.520
Even sold for thousands, it's fair.

41:15.120 --> 41:18.120
But for just a few strings?

41:18.200 --> 41:19.480
Isn't that an insult?

41:19.560 --> 41:21.200
You're from nowhere.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.400
Easy to explain, hard to hear.

41:24.160 --> 41:25.240
Let me be honest.

41:25.880 --> 41:29.720
I'm the third daughter of the Li family
from Sifu House on Pan Street.

41:29.800 --> 41:32.640
Across from us is Master Chai,
the new owner of Pan Restaurant.

41:32.720 --> 41:35.960
He's ruthless and shameless.

41:36.640 --> 41:38.640
I despise him
for ruining my family's business.

41:39.520 --> 41:41.640
So, I tricked him out of a fortune

41:41.720 --> 41:44.760
and hid it somewhere safe.
I've kept it hidden ever since.

41:45.480 --> 41:48.280
If you spare me,

41:48.360 --> 41:52.000
I'll give you 380 strings

41:52.080 --> 41:53.320
for my freedom.

41:53.400 --> 41:56.800
Are you just stalling to escape?

41:57.640 --> 41:58.840
Why would you think that?

41:59.800 --> 42:01.600
I knew you'd doubt me.

42:01.680 --> 42:03.720
That's why I didn't speak until now.

42:03.800 --> 42:06.560
Master Chai is furious over his loss.

42:06.640 --> 42:09.000
He even smashed his prized jade comb.

42:09.600 --> 42:11.680
He's been seeking someone to repair it.

42:11.760 --> 42:13.200
How could that be a trick?

42:13.280 --> 42:15.240
And look around.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.440
This place is deserted.

42:16.520 --> 42:18.480
I could scream and no one would come.

42:18.560 --> 42:20.240
How dare I lie to you?

42:20.320 --> 42:22.560
A headless ghost would be my fate.

42:22.640 --> 42:24.360
Then tell me where it's hidden.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.760
I'll send someone to fetch it.

42:27.440 --> 42:28.680
Come closer, I'll tell you.

42:31.880 --> 42:33.000
Closer.

42:39.640 --> 42:40.920
Kangning, it's me.

42:42.880 --> 42:44.960
- You deserve this--
- Ruthless and shameless one.

42:46.000 --> 42:47.000
Enough already?

43:00.360 --> 43:02.000
Aren't you just toying with me,

43:02.080 --> 43:03.400
you scoundrel?

43:05.640 --> 43:06.720
So,

43:07.760 --> 43:09.080
you can mess with me,

43:09.160 --> 43:10.400
hit me, scold me,

43:10.480 --> 43:12.040
but I can't tease you back?

43:12.760 --> 43:14.040
When did you figure it out?

43:17.920 --> 43:20.280
What kidnapper uses Four Harmonies?

43:26.440 --> 43:28.760
- And Fuhui?
- Guarded safely by her husband.

43:28.840 --> 43:30.600
He even asked me to keep it secret.

43:30.680 --> 43:32.600
So he can play the hero later.

43:33.600 --> 43:35.000
Come. Let's get you home.

43:50.480 --> 43:52.440
Hold tight. We're heading back.

44:10.240 --> 44:11.720
Here we are, right up ahead.

44:11.800 --> 44:12.720
Okay.

44:16.120 --> 44:17.160
Take care, sir.

44:21.440 --> 44:23.800
Thanks for your patronage.
Hire from me again!

44:23.880 --> 44:24.920
Safe delivery guaranteed.

44:25.720 --> 44:26.720
Not good.

44:26.800 --> 44:29.080
If someone sees me
walking with a man at night,

44:29.680 --> 44:31.200
there'll be plenty of gossip.

44:57.240 --> 44:59.440
Mr. Zhang, this job's not done yet.

44:59.520 --> 45:01.280
We'll need another trip in a few days.

45:01.360 --> 45:02.760
I'll count on you.

45:02.840 --> 45:04.200
No problem.

45:05.680 --> 45:06.720
Isn't that Master Chai?

45:07.920 --> 45:10.160
The owner of Pan Restaurant, Master Chai?

45:10.240 --> 45:12.280
I haven't greeted you in a while.

45:12.800 --> 45:14.120
When free,

45:14.200 --> 45:15.440
visit my shop sometime.

45:15.520 --> 45:16.880
Been too busy lately.

45:16.960 --> 45:18.080
I'll come by another day.

45:18.160 --> 45:20.080
I'm rushing to send a maid for service.

45:20.160 --> 45:22.120
Don't want to miss the hour
or ruin my mother's banquet.

45:22.200 --> 45:24.440
I must go ahead. We'll talk another day.

45:24.520 --> 45:26.560
Alright, Master Chai, take care.

45:31.520 --> 45:34.400
A maid?

46:01.560 --> 46:02.560
Kangning.

46:03.320 --> 46:04.680
I didn't do this to tease you.

46:04.760 --> 46:06.560
Not for any other reason, just because…

46:08.200 --> 46:09.640
I wanted to spend more time with you.

46:23.160 --> 46:24.160
I'll be going.

47:13.840 --> 47:14.960
Hold on.

47:22.960 --> 47:24.840
If your sisters return, all's well.

47:24.920 --> 47:26.000
If not,

47:26.600 --> 47:28.640
I'll act like you two never existed.

47:30.240 --> 47:31.560
Mother!

47:31.640 --> 47:33.080
I was wrong!

47:33.160 --> 47:35.440
I'll never play around again,

47:35.520 --> 47:36.880
Mother.

47:36.960 --> 47:38.080
You're wrong, Mother.

47:38.160 --> 47:39.720
Even if we were there,

47:39.800 --> 47:41.440
we'd just be tied up too.

47:41.520 --> 47:43.640
It's the bandits' fault, not ours.

47:43.720 --> 47:45.720
Why blame us?

47:46.680 --> 47:48.040
Mother's just angry.

47:48.120 --> 47:50.640
If they don't return,

47:50.720 --> 47:52.840
I'll give my life for theirs.

47:52.920 --> 47:54.200
You still won't admit your fault?

47:54.280 --> 47:56.760
- You're to blame!
- Mother!

47:57.440 --> 47:58.560
I'm older than Leshan.

47:58.640 --> 48:01.600
Don't punish her alone. I'll take half.

48:02.600 --> 48:03.880
Mother.

48:03.960 --> 48:06.080
They're already missing. Don't hit them.

48:06.720 --> 48:10.120
What have I done to deserve this?

48:10.920 --> 48:13.720
My two daughters.

48:14.360 --> 48:17.000
How am I supposed to go on?

48:17.600 --> 48:19.720
Madam, they're back!

48:19.800 --> 48:20.960
They're back!

48:21.040 --> 48:22.240
Mother!

48:23.160 --> 48:25.200
- Kangning!
- Kangning!

48:28.440 --> 48:29.560
Mother!

48:30.440 --> 48:32.080
Kangning!

48:32.160 --> 48:33.520
I'm home.

48:33.600 --> 48:34.880
- Kangning!
- It's alright now.

48:34.960 --> 48:36.640
Kangning!

48:36.720 --> 48:38.040
I'm back.

48:38.120 --> 48:39.520
Good. It's okay.

48:39.600 --> 48:41.880
It's fine now. All fine.

48:41.960 --> 48:43.120
Don't cry.

48:43.200 --> 48:44.440
As long as you're back.

48:44.520 --> 48:45.920
You scared me.

48:46.000 --> 48:47.320
It's over now.

49:01.720 --> 49:02.800
Quickly!

49:18.480 --> 49:19.560
No!

49:21.160 --> 49:22.160
Come here. Come!

49:22.760 --> 49:23.680
Hit me once.

49:24.440 --> 49:25.840
Hit me!

49:26.440 --> 49:27.720
Hurry!

49:28.840 --> 49:29.800
Harder!

49:29.880 --> 49:31.080
Give me a good punch.

49:39.920 --> 49:40.760
Good punch!

49:45.400 --> 49:47.160
My lady, I've come to save you!

49:49.600 --> 49:50.840
Careful!

49:50.920 --> 49:52.080
Don't be afraid.

49:52.160 --> 49:53.000
I'm here.

49:55.360 --> 49:56.840
Are you alright, my lady?

49:56.920 --> 49:58.120
Are you hurt?

49:58.200 --> 49:59.560
Were you frightened?

50:01.320 --> 50:02.360
My lady?

50:04.160 --> 50:06.240
My lady.

50:06.320 --> 50:09.560
Why did you come so late?

50:11.600 --> 50:13.600
Don't be afraid, my lady.

50:13.680 --> 50:15.720
It's all my fault. I came too late.

50:15.800 --> 50:16.920
Don't be scared.

52:46.440 --> 52:50.080
Subtitle translation by: Jiayi Xu
